Bloom Box pairs a playful identity with a practical recommendation engine. We
worked across product strategy, visual language, and backend integrations to
turn plant care into a daily listening habit.

= Finding the rhythm

The interface balances clear care guidance with expressive artwork. A small
set of reusable patterns lets every plant feel distinct without making the
product difficult to navigate.

= A durable system

The final design system scales from a single desktop dashboard to compact
mobile controls and campaign pages.
